cts' with repeatable product blocks: each block has ONE product picker, so I can add one product at a time (4 or 5 total) and drag/reorder the blocks in the theme editor to change carousel order. Do not use a single multi-product picker. Show one full product panel at a time, matching the existing Paris Featured product / Trending Item appearance: large scrollable main product image gallery on the left, with SMALL clickable image thumbnails horizontally BELOW it; selected product title, price, a centered and polished quantity selector, Add to cart and Buy it now on the right. Show variant selection only if that product has actual variant choices. Put prominent previous/next PRODUCT arrows at the outside left and right edges of the entire carousel, separate from controls for scrolling the current product's main images. Each slide's image gallery, variants, quantity, and purchase actions must operate on that slide's product. Responsive on mobile. Do not make compact cards or a featured collection banner. Do not modify or remove the existing Trending Featured product section or other blocks., This is just one product, I wanted at least 4 to 6 , Give me the ability to change the container. And Make the images scrollable , Make the thumbnails 20% smaller. And can you also give me the ability to change colors fonts and picture container , The arrows to switch between products is gone. Bring it Back and the Add to Cart button is the same color as the button make it F4F1FF color, Other products are not showing , wait No products are showing , Change the quantity picker look better , Can you make the quanity picker a bit longer and make add to cart and buy it now all the same length so that it looks cohesive , Two changes. The second and third products are not showing. And give me the ability to adjust the container size of the product. 14pt space between buy it now and add to cart and 14pt space between variant picker and add to cart 
    
